      "message": "feat(machines): add Haas VF-2SS YT machine file\n\nAdd assets/machines/haas-vf2ssyt.mch with extended 508 mm Y-axis travel\n(-508.0..508.0 mm), 762 mm X travel, 508 mm Z travel, safe_retract 0.0,\n12,000 rpm / 22.4 kW rigid-tapping spindle, Flood M8 coolant, 21,158 mm/min\nfeed and 35,560 mm/min rapid rates, 30 CAT40 pockets (CAT40 ER32 default\nholder), and Haas post.\n\nRegister \"Haas VF-2SS YT\" in posting_files::MACHINES and embedded(), add\nspecification and Y-stroke limit pins in haas_machines.rs and machine.rs,\nlist haas-vf2ssyt.mch in site/content/guide/check-and-post/posting.md, and\nrecord the public Haas sources in docs/decisions/3682-haas-vf2ss-yt.md.\n\nFixes #3682",
